

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Programma atmiņas-pārvaldība: 0.

{
>> q := ['You should be able'].
q pievienot-beigās: ([' to append something to a string']+['!']).
Izvade rakstīt: q.
} palaist.

Programma satīrīt.
usedMemory1 := (Programma atmiņa ? 0).


